{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_1b543f70cfd849719be0117d","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Ralph Progress Log\n     2→\n     3→This file tracks progress across iterations. Agents update this file\n     4→after each iteration and it's included in prompts for context.\n     5→\n     6→## Codebase Patterns (Study These First)\n     7→\n     8→*Add reusable patterns discovered during development here.*\n     9→\n    10→---\n    11→\n    12→## 2024-02-08 - US-048\n    13→- Created complete website for Dra. Angélica Lucena - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n    14→- Files changed:\n    15→  - `site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena/index.html` (new)\n    16→- **Design Concept**: Ethereal/Luminous aesthetic with rose, gold, and champagne color palette. Organic blob shapes with floating animations create a dreamy, transformative atmosphere perfect for facial harmonization specialist.\n    17→- **Typography**: Cormorant Garamond (display) paired with Montserrat (body) for elegant, premium feel\n    18→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    19→  - Animated hero with 3 floating blob backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    20→  - Parallax mouse movement effect on blobs\n    21→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    22→  - Problem/Solution section with visual cards\n    23→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Bioestimuladores, Preenchimento Labial, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    24→  - 3 testimonial cards with star ratings\n    25→  - 6 differential items with icons\n    26→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    27→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    28→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    29→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    30→- **Contact Info**: R. Garibaldi, 1928 - Jardim Sumaré, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14025-382 | (16) 99635-3208\n    31→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-angelica-lucena\n    32→- **Verification**:\n    33→  - Desktop view tested: ✓\n    34→  - Mobile view (375x812) tested: ✓\n    35→  - Form submission to WhatsApp tested: ✓\n    36→  - Smooth scroll navigation tested: ✓\n    37→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    38→\n    39→**Learnings:**\n    40→- **Pattern**: Ethereal aesthetic works exceptionally well for facial harmonization/esthetic clinics - the soft gradients and luminous effects reinforce the \"glow\" and \"transformation\" aspects of the treatments\n    41→- **Pattern**: Using CSS variables for organic border-radius (`--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%`) creates unique blob shapes that animate beautifully\n    42→- **Pattern**: WhatsApp form integration is highly effective - converts form submissions directly into conversations\n    43→- **Gotcha**: Image URL from Unsplash (woman's face) appropriate for facial harmonization specialist\n    44→- **Gotcha**: The rose-gold-champagne palette (Ethereal Rose & Gold) creates a luxurious feminine aesthetic that appeals to the target demographic\n    45→- **Gotcha**: Cormorant Garamond as display font adds sophistication and elegance without being overly formal\n    46→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n    47→- **Mobile optimization**: Single-column layouts for grid components on mobile, stacked hero with image below content\n    48→\n    49→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n    50→- **Sapphire Noir & Champagne Palette**: `--color-sapphire: #1E3A5F`, `--color-sapphire-light: #2A5298`, `--color-sapphire-dark: #0F2440`, `--color-sapphire-deep: #0A1830`, `--color-champagne: #D4AF77`, `--color-champagne-light: #E5C89A`, `--color-champagne-dark: #B8945C`, `--color-ivory: #FAF8F5` - sophisticated, trustworthy premium aesthetic perfect for clinics seeking to convey reliability and elegance\n    51→- **Diamond Border Radius**: `--radius-diamond: 75% 25% 55% 45% / 45% 65% 35% 55%`, `--radius-diamond-2: 55% 45% 35% 65% / 65% 35% 55% 45%`, `--radius-diamond-3: 40% 60% 65% 35% / 55% 45% 35% 65%` for crystalline, geometric shapes with sharp architectural angles\n    52→- **Cinzel Decorative + Manrope Typography**: Roman-inspired decorative serif display font paired with modern geometric sans-serif body font for sophisticated elegance with excellent readability\n    53→\n    54→---\n    55→\n    56→## 2025-02-08 - US-055\n    57→- Created complete website for Remon - Harmonização Facial e Estética Avançada em Ribeirão Preto\n    58→- Files changed:\n    59→  - `site-demo/remon/index.html` (new)\n    60→- **Design Concept**: Sapphire Noir & Champagne aesthetic with deep sapphire blues, warm champagne gold accents on ivory backgrounds. A completely new direction from previous palettes - cool, sophisticated, and trustworthy with crystalline diamond-shaped border-radius patterns creating architectural, geometric animations.\n    61→- **Typography**: Cinzel Decorative (display) paired with Manrope (body) for Roman-inspired elegance with modern geometric readability\n    62→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n    63→  - Animated hero with 4 floating diamond-shaped backgrounds using gradient meshes\n    64→  - Diamond border-radius patterns (`--radius-diamond`, `--radius-diamond-2`, `--radius-diamond-3`) create crystalline, architectural shapes\n    65→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n    66→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n    67→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n    68→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars\n    69→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n    70→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n    71→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n    72→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n    73→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n    74→- **Contact Info**: Sala 715 - Nova Ribeirânia, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14096-730 | (16) 98142-0597\n    75→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/remon\n    76→- **Verification**:\n    77→  - Desktop view verified: ✓\n    78→  - Mobile view (375x812) responsive: ✓\n    79→  - Mobile menu hamburger functional: ✓\n    80→  - Form submission to WhatsApp: ✓\n    81→  - Smooth scroll navigation: ✓\n    82→  - All sections present: Hero, Problema/Solução, Serviços, Depoimentos, Diferenciais, Contato, Footer: ✓\n    83→\n    84→**Learnings:**\n    85→- **Pattern**: Sapphire Noir & Champagne palette creates a cool, sophisticated aesthetic that conveys trust and premium quality - different from all warm palettes used previously (rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, emerald/silk, rose/quartz, amber/bronze, plum/gold)\n    86→- **Pattern**: Diamond border-radius shapes (`75% 25% 55% 45% / 45% 65% 35% 55%`) provide a more geometric, crystalline interpretation of blobmorphism with sharp architectural angles that differentiate from organic petal/flame shapes\n    87→- **Pattern**: Cinzel Decorative + Manrope typography pairing combines Roman-inspired decorative serif elegance with modern geometric sans-serif for sophisticated readability that feels classical yet contemporary\n    88→- **Gotcha**: The sapphire-champagne-ivory palette feels more trustworthy and professional while maintaining premium positioning - it evokes feelings of reliability, confidence, and excellence\n    89→- **Gotcha**: Diamond-shaped borders create a distinctive crystalline aesthetic with sharp angles that feels architectural and modern - completely different from the soft organic curves of previous sites\n    90→- **Gotcha**: Ivory backgrounds (#FAF8F5) provide warmth without being as yellow-based as 